### Comments

- Write doc comments in JSDoc format.
- Refer to [TypeScript JSDoc Reference](https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/jsdoc-supported.html) for supported tags.
<!-- Project-specific / TypeScript-Comments -->

### Errors

- Treat `catch (error)` as `unknown`: narrow it with `instanceof` before reading anything from it.
- Return expected outcomes as a discriminated union (`{ ok: true; value: T } | { ok: false; reason: Reason }`), and keep `throw` for genuine failures.
- Validate external data at the boundary with a schema, and derive the type from the schema; a cast validates nothing.
<!-- Project-specific / TypeScript-Errors -->

